{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"postwar-bardic-walleye","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Reproduction\n1. Run a ticket write whose description or linked context contains short hexadecimal fragments that are ambiguous ticket-id prefixes.\n2. Observe the write commit successfully, then the post-write enrichment drain emits repeated errors such as `Ambiguous prefix 'a9dd' matches multiple tickets` for fragments that were not intended as ticket citations.\n3. The originating CLI process remains alive after the ticket state change and must be interrupted.\n\n## Expected\nCitation enrichment recognizes only explicit ticket-reference syntax and post-write commands exit promptly after a successful write.\n\n## Actual\nThe scanner resolves unrelated four-character hex fragments as ticket ids, emits repeated ambiguity errors, and leaves the post-write command running after its state transition has committed. Reproduced during duplicate-consolidation transitions on 2026-08-08; affected fragments included a9dd, dbb2, 3e8b, 03ef, 94a3, c5b3, 18ae, and 4527.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A regression test feeds prose containing ambiguous four-hex fragments without explicit citation syntax and proves the enrichment drain does not resolve them as tickets.\n- [ ] Explicit supported ticket citations continue to resolve.\n- [ ] A successful ticket write exits after the bounded enrichment drain even when candidate text contains ambiguous fragments.\n- [ ] The original post-write reproduction completes without ambiguity errors or a lingering process.","id":"c50e-7326-9cac-45e4","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Enrichment drain treats unrelated short hex fragments as ticket prefixes and hangs post-write commands"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786248760616961001,"uuid":"78d799d8-b455-4d33-ad0c-f674faa8e81a"}